ed-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"33052f37223a11c6\" href=\"?note=33052f37223a11c6\" title=\"73-df-cfg-structure\">73-df-cfg-structure</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}right\\text{-}left\\text{-}linear\\text{-}grammars}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RightLinear}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;[\\alpha\\in\\Sigma^*\\lor\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\exists B\\in V\\;\\alpha=uB]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}right\\text{-}left\\text{-}linear\\text{-}grammars}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RightLinear}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;[\\alpha\\in\\Sigma^*\\lor\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\exists B\\in V\\;\\alpha=uB]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}right\\text{-}left\\text{-}linear\\text{-}grammars}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{LeftLinear}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;[\\alpha\\in\\Sigma^*\\lor\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\exists B\\in V\\;\\alpha=Bu]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}right\\text{-}left\\text{-}linear\\text{-}grammars}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{LeftLinear}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;[\\alpha\\in\\Sigma^*\\lor\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\exists B\\in V\\;\\alpha=Bu]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}right\\text{-}left\\text{-}linear\\text{-}grammars}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RegularGrammar}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{RightLinear}(G)\\lor\\operatorname{LeftLinear}(G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}right\\text{-}left\\text{-}linear\\text{-}grammars}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RegularGrammar}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{RightLinear}(G)\\lor\\operatorname{LeftLinear}(G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>“右线性或左线性”作用于整本文法，不能改成每条产生式各自任选一种，否则混用左右规则可能生成非正则语言。u 可以为空，故允许单位和空产生式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-structure","status":"resolved","id":"33052f37223a11c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$，见 [[73-df-cfg-structure]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}right\\text{-}left\\text{-}linear\\text{-}grammars}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RightLinear}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;[\\alpha\\in\\Sigma^*\\lor\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\exists B\\in V\\;\\alpha=uB]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}right\\text{-}left\\text{-}linear\\text{-}grammars}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{LeftLinear}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;[\\alpha\\in\\Sigma^*\\lor\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\exists B\\in V\\;\\alpha=Bu]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}right\\text{-}left\\text{-}linear\\text{-}grammars}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RegularGrammar}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{RightLinear}(G)\\lor\\operatorname{LeftLinear}(G)","display":true}],"bytes":1957,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-383","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-right-left-linear-grammars|右线性与左线性文法]]"},{"id":"d7f8e16ecf4a3b9b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；线性文法、生成语言、正则语言分别见 [[73-df-right-left-linear-grammars]]、[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]、[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]。"}],"outgoing":["33052f37223a11c6"]}